Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["InsertCitation", "ObjectName",
 CellID->435104390,ExpressionUUID->"2f5f4aff-0d03-4ef4-b1d9-b46dcb3e5714"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"0f12fcf1-f9cb-43a6-aa78-bc891b12c676"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["InsertCitation",
    BaseStyle->"Link",
    ButtonData->"paclet:WolframInstitute/MathNotebook/ref/InsertCitation"], 
   RowBox[{"[", "]"}]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "50de3846-eeff-4250-a85f-46767b82c10a"],
 " \[LineSeparator]",
 "inserts a citation link to a tagged cell."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->306585204,ExpressionUUID->"181f92d6-418d-4335-b462-3bc1f6d20794"],

Cell["\<\
Acts on the current position in the front end. There is no result to compute, \
and the function does nothing in a kernel with no front end.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->518107539,ExpressionUUID->"758130c9-61ae-4054-9530-c99e98a903c1"],

Cell["\<\
A numbered environment is cited by its number, which follows the target when \
cells move. A Reference cell is cited by its tag.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->650958658,ExpressionUUID->"6ec2008d-e75d-47d2-a65b-be557aa80e7a"],

Cell["\<\
The number is a front end counter box resolved at the tagged cell, not at the \
citation, so it needs no kernel, is correct in the printed PDF, and renumbers \
itself when cells are reordered.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->284903514,ExpressionUUID->"26b2c6d7-4e46-4999-882d-52c5407579ff"],

Cell["\<\
The style of the target is resolved when the citation is inserted, so the \
citation reads \"Theorem 2\" rather than a bare number. A tag that no cell \
carries falls back to the tag in brackets.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->604985446,ExpressionUUID->"5533d3f0-3b8c-4b9e-904d-949aa5ad4eb6"],

Cell["\<\
An unknown tag renders as XXX, so a citation inserted before its target \
exists must be reinserted once the target is tagged.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->229521946,ExpressionUUID->"25e6d5e4-3920-43f8-b6c2-c3c3f1b343ee"]
}, Open  ]],

